---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import LabObservationBar from '../../components/LabObservationBar.astro';
import NextExploration from '../../components/NextExploration.astro';
import '../../styles/lens.css';
import '../../styles/spatial.css';
---
<SiteLayout title="透镜成像 · 把一束光，变成一幅像" description="移动物体与光屏，亲手对焦。从照相机到放大镜，用光路与实时数据发现凸透镜成像的规律。">
 <div class="lens-lab wrap">
  <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/spaces/physics/">物理实验室</a> / 透镜成像</p>
  <header class="lens-intro"><div><p class="kicker">光学工作室 · 从照相机到放大镜</p><h1>把一束光，<br/>变成一幅<span>像。</span></h1></div><div class="intro-question"><p>同一片透镜，为什么既能拍下远处风景，<br/>又能放大眼前的小字？</p><p>移动物体，寻找光线相遇的地方。再移动光屏，亲手把模糊变成清晰。</p></div></header>
  <section class="prediction-strip" aria-labelledby="predict-heading"><div><h2 id="predict-heading">先猜一猜</h2><p>把物体放到焦点里面，像会怎样？</p></div><div class="prediction-actions"><button data-prediction="real" type="button" aria-pressed="false">仍是倒立的实像</button><button data-prediction="virtual" type="button" aria-pressed="false">变成正立的虚像</button><button data-prediction="none" type="button" aria-pressed="false">完全没有像</button></div><p id="prediction-feedback" role="status">先选一个想法，再用下方“放大镜”情景检验。</p></section>
  <section class="optical-workshop" aria-label="凸透镜光具座">
   <div class="workshop-heading"><div><p class="kicker">一片透镜，两种看世界的方式</p><h2>让光线告诉你答案</h2></div><span class="instrument-id">OPTICS / 01<br/>理想薄凸透镜</span></div>
   <div class="lens-demo"><div><button id="lens-demo" class="lens-primary" type="button">演示：跨越焦点</button><button id="lens-focus-demo" type="button">演示：寻找清晰像</button><button id="lens-pause" type="button" disabled>暂停演示</button></div><p id="lens-stage" aria-live="off">从“远处风景”开始：物体在 2f 外，光屏上能接到缩小、倒立的像。</p></div>
   <div class="lens-presets" role="group" aria-label="五种成像情景">{[['far','远处风景','u > 2f'],['equal','一样大小','u = 2f'],['near','投影特写','f < u < 2f'],['focus','恰在焦点','u = f'],['magnifier','放大镜','u < f']].map(([id,label,formula])=><button id={`lens-${id}`} data-lens-preset={id} type="button" aria-pressed={id==='far'?'true':'false'}><span>{label}</span><small>{formula}</small></button>)}</div>
   <div class="spatial-toolbar" id="lens-spatial-toolbar" hidden><div role="group" aria-label="光学台视角"><button data-lens-camera="perspective" type="button">立体全景</button><button data-lens-camera="front" type="button">正视光路</button><button data-lens-camera="top" type="button">俯看光具座</button><button data-lens-camera="screen" type="button">光屏特写</button></div><button id="lens-view-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="false">切换二维光路</button></div>
   <div id="lens-spatial" class="spatial-stage optics-stage" hidden></div>
   <p id="lens-spatial-note" class="spatial-note">二维光路可直接拖动物体与光屏。三维装置准备好后会在这里出现。</p>
   <div class="lens-apparatus"><div class="ray-workspace" id="lens-2d"><div class="ray-legend"><span class="gold">实线：经焦点的光</span><span class="teal">实线：过光心的光</span><span class="violet">虚线：反向延长 / 理论像</span></div>
    <svg id="lens-bench" viewBox="0 0 900 400" role="group" aria-label="光具座：物体在透镜左侧，光屏在右侧。可拖动橙色物体和蓝色光屏，或使用下方滑块。">
     <defs><pattern id="lens-grid" width="25" height="25" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><circle cx="1" cy="1" r="1" fill="#d3e3ed"/></pattern><clipPath id="lens-clip"><rect x="10" y="10" width="880" height="335"/></clipPath></defs>
     <rect width="900" height="400" fill="url(#lens-grid)"/><g id="lens-axis"><path d="M30 200H870" stroke="#a2b8c9"/><text x="440" y="350" fill="#5b7588">主光轴</text></g>
     <g clip-path="url(#lens-clip)"><g id="lens-rays"><path d="M180 160H450L585 220M180 160L585 220" stroke="#c58b16" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/></g><g id="lens-image"><path d="M585 200V220m-6 -9l6 9 6 -9" fill="none" stroke="#7560ad" stroke-width="3"/></g></g>
     <g id="lens-glass"><path d="M450 90Q425 200 450 310Q475 200 450 90Z" fill="#b9e7ef" fill-opacity=".6" stroke="#66a6bb" stroke-width="2"/></g>
     <g id="lens-object" role="slider" tabindex="0" aria-label="移动物体，物距厘米" aria-valuemin="5" aria-valuemax="80" aria-valuenow="30"><rect x="160" y="140" width="40" height="100" fill="transparent"/><path d="M180 200V160m-8 12l8 -12 8 12" stroke="#c58b16" stroke-width="7" fill="none"/><text x="180" y="280" text-anchor="middle" fill="#153b56">物体</text></g>
     <g id="lens-screen" role="slider" tabindex="0" aria-label="移动光屏，屏距厘米" aria-valuemin="5" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="15"><rect x="573" y="90" width="24" height="220" rx="4" fill="#dcebf6" fill-opacity=".65" stroke="#4187b6" stroke-width="2"/><text x="585" y="330" text-anchor="middle" fill="#153b56">光屏</text></g>
    </svg>
    <p id="lens-view-note" class="view-note">图中轮廓箭头标出理论像；右侧小窗单独观察光屏。可拖动物体与光屏。</p>
   </div><aside class="screen-observer" aria-labelledby="screen-heading"><div class="observer-heading"><h3 id="screen-heading">光屏上看到了什么？</h3><span id="screen-badge">接近清晰</span></div>
    <svg id="screen-preview" viewBox="0 0 240 190" role="img" aria-label="光屏示意：倒立缩小的像"><defs><filter id="screen-blur"><feGaussianBlur id="screen-blur-value" stdDeviation="0"/></filter></defs><rect x="20" y="12" width="200" height="160" rx="8" fill="#f7fbfe" stroke="#c4d8e6"/><path d="M40 92H200M120 30V155" stroke="#dfebf1" stroke-dasharray="3 5"/><g id="screen-projection"><path d="M120 92V120m-8 -12l8 12 8 -12" stroke="#c58b16" stroke-width="7" fill="none"/></g></svg>
    <p id="screen-explain">光屏刚好在光线会合处，接到倒立、缩小的实像。</p><p class="observer-footnote">F 让上下、左右翻转一眼可见。几何调焦示意，不模拟亮度和像差。</p><div id="magnifier-observer" hidden><h3>从透镜另一侧看</h3><div id="magnifier-glyph" class="magnifier-glyph" aria-label="正立放大的虚像">F</div><p>眼睛观察示意：正立、放大；不是光屏投影。</p></div>
   </aside></div>
   <div class="lens-controls"><label for="object-distance">移动物体 <output id="object-distance-value">30.0 cm</output><input id="object-distance" type="range" min="5" max="80" step="0.1" value="30"/><small>物距 u：物体到透镜</small></label><label for="screen-distance">移动光屏 <output id="screen-distance-value">15.0 cm</output><input id="screen-distance" type="range" min="5" max="100" step="0.1" value="15"/><small>屏距 s：独立寻找清晰位置</small></label><label for="focal-length">换一片透镜 <output id="focal-length-value">10.0 cm</output><input id="focal-length" type="range" min="6" max="16" step="0.5" value="10"/><small>焦距 f：焦点也会跟着改变</small></label></div>
   <div class="spatial-fine" role="group" aria-label="精细调焦">微调 0.1 cm：<button data-lens-step="object-distance:-0.1" type="button">物体靠近</button><button data-lens-step="object-distance:0.1" type="button">物体远离</button><button data-lens-step="screen-distance:-0.1" type="button">光屏靠近</button><button data-lens-step="screen-distance:0.1" type="button">光屏远离</button></div>
   <div class="lens-toolbar"><label><input id="show-extensions" type="checkbox" checked/> 显示虚像的反向延长线</label><button id="lens-reset" type="button">重新探索</button></div>
   <noscript><p class="lens-noscript">启用 JavaScript 可移动物体和光屏。当前静态情景：f=10 cm、u=30 cm，v=15 cm，m=−0.5，得到倒立缩小的实像。下方原理与探索路线仍可阅读。</p></noscript>
  </section>
  <section class="lens-evidence" aria-labelledby="evidence-heading"><div class="evidence-title"><p class="kicker">光路是证据，公式是解释</p><h2 id="evidence-heading">同一个变化，三种看法</h2><p id="lens-conclusion">物体在 2f 外，形成倒立、缩小的实像。</p></div><dl class="lens-readouts"><div><dt>理论像距 v</dt><dd id="image-distance">15.00 cm</dd></div><div><dt>带符号放大率 m</dt><dd id="lens-magnification">−0.50 ×</dd></div><div><dt>像的性质</dt><dd id="image-nature">倒立 · 缩小 · 实像</dd></div><div><dt>屏上两光线分离量</dt><dd id="ray-separation">0.000 cm</dd></div></dl>
   <div class="lens-formula-grid"><div><p class="formula-label">位置关系 · 薄透镜公式</p><p class="lens-formula">1/f = 1/u + 1/v</p><p id="lens-substitution">1/10 = 1/30 + 1/15（cm⁻¹）</p><p class="formula-label">大小与方向 · 负号代表倒立</p><p class="lens-formula">m = −v/u</p><p id="magnification-substitution">−15 / 30 = −0.50</p></div><div><h3>物体与理论像 · 高度比较</h3><div id="lens-height-bars"></div><p id="lens-comparison">物高 2.00 cm，像高 −1.00 cm。负像高在主轴下方。</p><p class="evidence-footnote">分离量来自物体顶端的两条代表光线，是调焦指示；小于物高的 4% 时显示“接近清晰”，不是实际分辨率。</p></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="lens-challenges" aria-labelledby="challenge-heading"><div><p class="kicker">带着目的，再试一次</p><h2 id="challenge-heading">今天，你来做光学设计师</h2></div><div class="challenge-options"><button data-challenge="small" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><strong>拍下远处风景</strong><span>接到一个倒立、缩小的清晰实像</span></button><button data-challenge="large" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><strong>让小图案登上大屏</strong><span>接到一个倒立、放大的清晰实像</span></button><button data-challenge="upright" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><strong>做一只放大镜</strong><span>找到正立、放大的虚像</span></button></div><p id="challenge-feedback" role="status">选择一个挑战，自己调一调；按钮只准备条件，不会替你完成调焦。</p><button id="check-challenge" class="lens-primary" type="button">检验我的设计</button></section>
  <section class="lens-notebook" aria-labelledby="notebook-heading"><div class="notebook-heading"><div><p class="kicker">留下证据，比较才有依据</p><h2 id="notebook-heading">我的光学观察</h2></div><div><button id="record-lens" type="button">记下这一刻</button><button id="clear-lens-records" type="button">清空记录</button></div></div><p id="record-feedback" role="status">最多记录六组条件，仅保留在当前页面。试着固定焦距，只改变物距。</p><div class="notebook-scroll" tabindex="0" aria-label="观测数据表，可横向滚动"><table><caption>单位：距离 cm；m 为带符号放大率</caption><thead><tr><th>u</th><th>f</th><th>屏距</th><th>v</th><th>m</th><th>观察</th></tr></thead><tbody id="lens-records"><tr><td colspan="6">还没有记录。改变一个条件，记下你的第一个发现。</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
  <section class="lens-reading"><article><p class="kicker">把观察带回生活</p><h2>照相机和放大镜，<br/>原来是同一条规律。</h2><p>物体在焦点外，透镜后的光线能在另一侧会合，形成倒立的实像。照相机的感光面、投影仪的幕布，都需要放在合适的位置才能清晰。</p><p>物体在焦点内，出射光线仍然散开。眼睛把这些光线向后追溯，仿佛来自物体同侧一个更大、更远的图案——这就是正立的虚像。虚线只是追溯方向，那里没有光线真正会合。</p><p>下一次拿起放大镜，先猜：想放大文字，透镜应该靠近纸，还是离纸很远？</p></article><article class="lens-model-note"><h2>这张光路图，省略了什么？</h2><p>这里采用空气中的理想薄凸透镜、近轴近似，物高固定为 2 cm。实像的像距为正，虚像为负；焦点处出射光平行，没有有限像距。图示为了可读性放大了透镜厚度。</p><p>两条代表光线说明物体顶端怎样成像，并非只有两条光。光屏不透明，会截住到达它的光；轮廓箭头只是理论像的位置。光屏两面使用同一投影图案便于转动观察，真实不透明光屏需从入光面观察。光屏预览不计算真实孔径、光强、像差、衍射或眼睛成像。</p><p>光路与案例表达参考 <a href="https://github.com/ricktu288/ray-optics">Ray Optics</a>；本页模型、界面和图形独立实现。</p></article></section>
  <LabObservationBar stage="#lens-spatial, #lens-2d, #screen-preview, #magnifier-observer" controls=".lens-controls, .spatial-fine, .lens-toolbar" readouts={[{"label": "像的性质", "id": "image-nature"}, {"label": "理论像距", "id": "image-distance"}]}/>
 <NextExploration slug="lens"/>
 </div>
 <script>import '../../scripts/exploration/lens';</script>
</SiteLayout>
